<title>PHILIPPINES: Kuok Q3 net 59.116 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Kuok Q3 net 59.116 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Condominium builder Kuok Philippine Properties Inc posted net income of 59.116 million pesos in the third quarter of the year, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission on Tuesday said.</p>
<p>Revenues reached 147.656 million pesos, while expenses amounted to 88.540 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
